                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>

        </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 80, background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 24px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 5, height: 40, background: '#CB6B28' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#CB6B28' }}>少量样本只称练习观察</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779' }}>不挑最好的一次归因；修改提示是一种干预，效果要通过任务结果判断。</Text>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>2.2 Prompt：把愿望写成可以检查的任务</Text>
